1
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:16,966
Fei.

2
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:19,566
Today, I saved your life on the knife ladder.

3
00:00:20,266 --> 00:00:22,666
How do you plan to repay me?

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:23,600
Sister Nan,

5
00:00:23,966 --> 00:00:24,800
I don't need to thank you.

6
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,500
You can ask me to do anything.

7
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:27,300
except,

8
00:00:27,566 --> 00:00:28,400
for the Nine Li Ghost Plate.

9
00:00:28,566 --> 00:00:28,966
Bah!

10
00:00:29,566 --> 00:00:30,133
what are you talking about?

11
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,333
I'm not the kind of person who changes his mind.

12
00:00:33,066 --> 00:00:33,933
You know, right?

13
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:35,066
Miss Miao

14
00:00:35,166 --> 00:00:35,733
come.

15
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,133
Let's have a drink first.

16
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,366
Fei,

17
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,200
Is okay?

18
00:00:42,966 --> 00:00:44,566
Miss Miao feels sorry for him.

19
00:00:45,066 --> 00:00:45,933
Then you drink for him.

20
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:47,966
Fei,

21
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,700
I can't drink.

22
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:51,433
Just watch quietly.

23
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:55,233
Your fiancée can pretend to be very good.

24
00:00:58,933 --> 00:00:59,933
This is interesting.

25
00:01:00,233 --> 00:01:00,766
Fei,

26
00:01:01,166 --> 00:01:01,833
pour the wine.

27
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:13,433
Fei, I'm hot.

28
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:17,866
Fei,

29
00:01:18,133 --> 00:01:19,300
I'm dizzy.

30
00:01:19,766 --> 00:01:21,300
I'm so dizzy.

31
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:23,166
I really want to sleep in your arms.

32
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:24,966
Aah!

33
00:01:24,966 --> 00:01:25,500
You drink.

34
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,333
I'm going to sleep.

35
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,366
Miss Liu,

36
00:01:33,966 --> 00:01:36,000
do you think I really can't drink you?

37
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:38,833
We Jiu Li women drink with bowls.

38
00:01:43,133 --> 00:01:43,666
Okay,

39
00:01:44,066 --> 00:01:44,900
you finally stop pretending.

40
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:45,400
Come!

41
00:01:45,666 --> 00:01:46,666
Today, it's either you or me.

42
00:01:53,466 --> 00:01:55,000
Long Fei is mine.

43
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:56,666
Is mine.

44
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,033
Can anyone save me?

45
00:02:44,433 --> 00:02:45,200
You guys.

46
00:02:46,266 --> 00:02:47,366
We're fine.

47
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,700
I said, ladies,

48
00:02:49,333 --> 00:02:50,333
can you let me go first?

49
00:02:50,433 --> 00:02:50,966
No.

50
00:02:52,266 --> 00:02:52,933
Stop the car!

51
00:02:53,266 --> 00:02:54,500
Why are you driving so fast?

52
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,400
Brother Tian,

53
00:03:09,633 --> 00:03:10,666
I have nothing with him.

54
00:03:10,966 --> 00:03:11,966
It's just a play.

55
00:03:12,133 --> 00:03:13,066
I only have you in my heart.

56
00:03:13,666 --> 00:03:15,066
I, Zhao Jitian, have seen all kinds of women.

57
00:03:15,466 --> 00:03:16,966
I don't need a married woman to serve me.

58
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:18,466
As long as I find the Chiyou Secret Treasure,

59
00:03:18,666 --> 00:03:20,266
Then the engagement is still my father's word.

60
00:03:21,933 --> 00:03:22,666
Last night,

61
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,666
I saw it.

62
00:03:28,433 --> 00:03:29,166
I saw it with my own eyes.

63
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,833
Nine-Tribes Ghost Plate is just a tool.

64
00:03:31,166 --> 00:03:33,500
and two artifacts are the keys to open the Tian Gong Tower.

65
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:34,666
So I have to follow Long Fei.

66
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,333
Good.

67
00:03:38,233 --> 00:03:39,933
You're worthy of being my Zhao Jitian's woman.

68
00:03:45,966 --> 00:03:47,200
The road is very strange today,

69
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,066
we need to turn around.

70
00:03:49,666 --> 00:03:50,700
It's just a trick.

71
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:51,233
You,

72
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,033
go down and see.

73
00:03:52,666 --> 00:03:53,033
Zhao Gongzi,

74
00:03:53,066 --> 00:03:53,333
I,

75
00:03:53,333 --> 00:03:54,033
Stop talking nonsense

76
00:03:54,233 --> 00:03:54,833
go down.

77
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,133
Follow me.

78
00:04:31,333 --> 00:04:32,500
What's the origin of this thing?

79
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:33,766
Is it dead or alive?

80
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,466
It's my master.
